{
  "comment": [
    "Thresholds for the deviation of the fault1d and fault2d cases from their",
    "exact solution, keyed by case and build configuration; see fault1d.py",
    "and seissol_add_fault1d. Deviations are relative to the amplitude of the",
    "exact signal, those of the rupture, the dynamic stress and the healing",
    "time to the time itself; the state of aging and slip law is compared by",
    "its logarithm. On fault2d, the amplitude is the one up to the time to",
    "which the exact solution holds at the receiver; on fault2d-periodic, the",
    "exact solution is the one of the spectral method of antiplane.py at the",
    "receiver (see run_case.compare_antiplane)."
